<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="lede">Last updated October 2026.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
<p>WebConvertPro ("we") respects your privacy and handles personal information in line with Canada's Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA).</p>
<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>When you submit a form on this site we collect the details you enter: your name, business name, email, phone number, website address and message. Our hosting provider also records standard technical data such as IP address and browser type for security.</p>
<h2>How we use it</h2>
<p>We use your information only to prepare the plan or quote you requested and to reply to you. We do not sell, rent or share your information with third parties for marketing.</p>
<h2>Where it's stored</h2>
<p>Form submissions are processed and stored by Netlify, our hosting provider, and delivered to our business email. We may use analytics tools such as Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site; this data is aggregated and does not identify you.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2>
<p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete the information we hold about you at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
